ing Post","eliteLevel":"Base","description":"When this Operator is assigned to the same Trading Post as Lappland , Morale consumed each hour +0.3 , and order acquisition efficiency +65%"},{"name":"Tacit Understanding","facility":"Trading Post","eliteLevel":"Elite 2","description":"When this Operator is assigned to the same Trading Post as Exusiai , Morale consumed each hour -0.3"}],"modules":[{"type":"Original","name":"Texas's Badge","stages":[]},{"type":"Upgrade","name":"SOL-Y: Private Field Supply Package","mission":{"requirement1":"Complete a total of 5 battles; You must deploy your own Texas, and unleash Sword Rain at least 1 time in each battle","requirement2":"Clear Side Story CB-3 with a 3-star rating; You must deploy your own Texas, and cannot include any other Vanguard Operators as members"},"stages":[{"stage":"Stage 1","attributesIncreased":"HP +100 , ATK +35 , DEF +15","effectLabel":"New trait","effectText":"The first Deployment Cost -4","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":2},{"name":"RMA70-24","quantity":3},{"name":"LMD","quantity":40000}]},{"stage":"Stage 2","attributesIncreased":"HP +130 , ATK +39 , DEF +19","effectLabel":"Tactical Delivery improved","effectText":"While this unit is in the squad, start with 2 additional DP . Skills deal 10% more damage","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":2},{"name":"Data Supplement Stick","quantity":20},{"name":"Grindstone Pentahydrate","quantity":4},{"name":"LMD","quantity":50000}]},{"stage":"Stage 3","attributesIncreased":"HP +155 , ATK +42 , DEF +22","effectLabel":"Tactical Delivery improved","effectText":"While this unit is in the squad, start with 2 additional DP. Skills deal 15% more damage","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":2},{"name":"Data Supplement Instrument","quantity":8},{"name":"Manganese Trihydrate","quantity":5},{"name":"LMD","quantity":60000}]}]}],"review":{"official":"Texas is a\nPenguin Logistics\nstaff member who is extraordinary skilled in single combat. She was assigned as liaison to\nRhodes Island\n, where she assisted with many different operations.","editor":null,"rating":null},"synergies":[],"techniques":[{"technique":null,"techniqueDescription":null,"description":null}],"guides":[],"stats":{"phases":[{"elite":0,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":50,"base":{"hp":727,"atk":203,"def":139,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":11,"block":2,"interval":1.05},"max":{"hp":996,"atk":299,"def":208,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":11,"block":2,"interval":1.05},"rangeId":"1-1"},{"elite":1,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":70,"base":{"hp":996,"atk":299,"def":208,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":13,"block":2,"interval":1.05},"max":{"hp":1365,"atk":410,"def":274,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":13,"block":2,"interval":1.05},"rangeId":"1-1"},{"elite":2,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":80,"base":{"hp":1365,"atk":410,"def":274,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":13,"block":2,"interval":1.05},"max":{"hp":1950,"atk":500,"def":343,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":13,"block":2,"interval":1.05},"rangeId":"1-1"}],"trust":{"hp":0,"atk":70,"def":0}},"files":[{"section":"Clinical Analysis","unlock":"Unlocked at 25 trust","description":"Imaging tests reveal clear, normal outlines of internal organs, and no abnormal shadows have been detected. Originium granules have not been detected in the circulatory system and there is no sign of infection. At this time, this Operator is believed to be non-infected. \n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 0% \nOperator Texas showed no symptoms of Oripathy. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.12u/L \nOperator Texas sometimes delivers packages with Originium content, but it has not caused infection to date."},{"section":"Archive File 1","unlock":"Unlocked at 50 trust","description":"A taciturn messenger. \nAccording to her own account, she's not hiding anything, just has nothing to say. \nThough she gives off the impression being a loner, she is often seen with her fellow Penguin Logistics employees."},{"section":"Archive File 2","unlock":"Unlocked at 100 trust","description":"While Texas may be quiet, her fighting style is anything but. It's best described as tempestuous. \nAt Rhodes Island, Operators without formal training are actually the majority, but when it comes to the use of weapons, most will follow established protocols. Texas, however, doesn't. \nWhile she is a bit more reserved now, one can still see vestiges of an idea that she herself might not be aware of - her belief that the singular purpose of all weaponry is to kill."},{"section":"Archive File 3","unlock":"Unlocked at 150 trust","description":"Her Lupo origin, her conspicuous fur color, her notable combat style, and of course, her name, all point to her ties with the faded Texas family, a once-famous clan whose name is now forgotten to most. \nIf that's the case, Texas's past is probably astonishing beyond imagination, as indicated by the Texas name itself. \nOn the one hand, even with Rhodes Island's intel network, very little is known about the family's fate. On the other hand, Texas never felt the need to elaborate on her past, so there isn't a pressing need to delve into it. After all, her past may one day catch up to her, just as she predicts."},{"section":"Archive File 4","unlock":"Unlocked at 200 trust","description":"Although Texas never discusses her past, that's not the same as actively avoiding the topic. It's more like apathy. \nFrom the way she has adapted to her current life, it's obvious she isn't running from anything. Routine work, bickering colleagues, Lungmen, and Rhodes Island are now everything to her. \nWe could sum it up like this: \nWhen the past does catch up to her, she will face it with composure--unless it disrupts her present, then we'll witness the genuine rage inside her."},{"section":"Promotion Record","unlock":"Unlocked at E2","description":"Texas is a handful. Even when she lets you get close, she won't spare more than a few words. It took me a long time to figure out whether we were cool or not. \nSigh. Anyone trying to be her friend is in for a reckoning. \n—Exusiai"}]},"appearances":[{"label":"Base","iconPath":"/five-star-icons/Texas%20-%20Base.webp","fullPath":"/five-star-skins/Texas%20-%20Base.webp"},{"label":"Elite 2","iconPath":"/five-star-icons/Texas%20-%20Elite%202.webp","fullPath":"/five-star-skins/Texas%20-%20Elite%202.webp"},{"label":"Willpower","iconPath":"/five-star-icons/Texas%20-%20Willpower.webp","fullPath":"/five-star-skins/Texas%20-%20Willpower.webp"},{"label":"Winter Messenger","iconPath":"/five-star-icons/Texas%20-%20Winter%20Messenger.webp","fullPath":"/five-star-skins/Texas%20-%20Winter%20Messenger.webp"}],"skinObtainByLabel":{"Willpower":"15 OP","Winter Messenger":"15 OP"},"synergyMatches":[],"autoSynergyGroups":[{"name":"Siracusa","type":"faction","entries":[{"operatorName":"Lappland the Decadenza","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Lappland%20the%20Decadenza%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T2","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T2","sourceText":"When this unit is in the squad, all [Siracusa] Operators gain +6 (+1) Initial SP","matchedKeyword":"Siracusa"}]},{"operatorName":"Angelina","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Angelina%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":false,"badges":[]},{"operatorName":"Angelina the Mellow Wish","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Angelina%20the%20Mellow%20Wish%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":false,"badges":[]},{"operatorName":"Bellone","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Bellone%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":false,"badges":[]},{"operatorName":"Crownslayer","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Crownslayer%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":false,"badges":[]},{"operatorName":"Penance","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Penance%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":false,"badges":[]},{"operatorName":"Suzuran","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Suzuran%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":false,"badges":[]},{"operatorName":"Texas the Omertosa","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Texas%20the%20Omertosa%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":fa